sequenceDiagram
    participant IngestGW as Ingestion Gateway
    participant IngestCtrl as Ingest Controller
    participant Trans as Transcribe Service
    participant Enrich as Enrichment Service
    participant TRepo as Transcript Repository
    participant Mongo as Mongo DB
    participant PGV as pgvector

    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: POST /ingest (media URL/files)
    IngestCtrl->>Trans: transcribe(media)
    Trans->>TRepo: save(raw transcript)
    TRepo->>Mongo: INSERT transcript
    Trans-->>IngestCtrl: transcriptId

    IngestCtrl->>Enrich: enrich(transcriptId)
    Enrich->>TRepo: update(segments, topics, entities)
    TRepo->>Mongo: UPDATE transcript
    TRepo-->>PGV: upsert embeddings for segments
    IngestCtrl-->>IngestGW: 202 accepted + ids
